                <invention-title lang="de">BLUTENTNAHMESYSTEM MIT EINER PRALLPLATTE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">SYSTÈME DE COLLECTE DE SANG COMPRENANT UN DÉFLECTEUR</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">BLOOD COLLECTION SYSTEM INCLUDING A BAFFLE</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A blood sample collection system, may include a housing, the housing including a blood collection port; and a baffle chamber; a needle formed through the housing and into the blood collection port; and a baffle formed within the baffle chamber to counteract a vacuum within a blood collection tube when pierced by the needle.</p>
            </abstract>
